289	  "highlights": ["notable process strength 1", "notable process strength 2"],
290	  "summary": "2-3 sentences a judge can read at a glance"
291	}
292	
293	Compute bonus_score as the weighted average of the four process_quality scores: (ownership*35 + specificity*25 + iteration*25 + edge*15) / 100, rounded to 1 decimal. Be fair but discriminating: most teams should land 4-7; reserve 8+ for genuinely strong, owned, iterative process.`;
294	
295	  const promptBlock =
296	    session.promptSamples.length > 0
297	      ? session.promptSamples
298	          .map((p, i) => `<session-prompt index="${i + 1}">\n${p}\n</session-prompt>`)
299	          .join("\n")
300	      : "[No readable prompt text was captured. Judge conservatively from metadata only.]";
301	
302	  const user = `${buildChallengeContext({ challenge: params.challenge, briefText: params.briefText })}
303	
304	## Repository Overview (for diff-alignment check)
305	- Primary Language: ${params.metadata.primary_language}
306	- Files: ${params.metadata.file_count}
307	- Commits: ${params.metadata.commit_count}
